[32m+[m[32m# Tradeork[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mMulti-user SaaS paper-trading platform for Indian markets (NSE, BSE, MCX).[m
[32m+[m[32mArchitected so the trading engine can later support real broker execution[m
[32m+[m[32m(Upstox first, then Zerodha/Groww) with strict PAPER/LIVE separation.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Status: Phase 1 — Portfolios, instruments + market data foundation.**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## What is implemented[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Backend** (`backend/`, Python 3.11 + FastAPI)[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Modular architecture: `core` / `api` / `models` / `schemas` / `services` / `repositories`[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Auth skeleton: registration, login, refresh-token rotation, logout[m
[32m+[m[32m    - Argon2id password hashing[m
[32m+[m[32m    - Short-lived access JWT (Authorization header) + opaque httpOnly refresh cookie[m
[32m+[m[32m    - Refresh tokens stored hashed, revocable, rotation on every refresh[m
[32m+[m[32m    - Per-IP rate limiting on auth endpoints (Redis-backed, in-memory fallback)[m
[32m+[m[32m  - SQLAlchemy 2.0 models + Alembic migrations (`users`, `refresh_tokens`,[m
[32m+[m[32m    `audit_logs`, `portfolios`, `instruments`)[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Portfolios: tenant-scoped CRUD (list/create/get/update/delete), unique name[m
[32m+[m[32m    per user, Decimal capital, ownership enforced in the service layer[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Instruments: reference catalog (NSE/BSE/MCX, equity/futures/options) with[m
[32m+[m[32m    search (symbol/name, exchange, instrument type) and natural-key dedupe[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Market data foundation: provider abstraction + clearly-labelled mock[m
[32m+[m[32m    provider (`is_mock: true`, `source: "mock"`), Redis-cached quotes (TTL 2s)[m
[32m+[m[32m    that degrade gracefully to provider-only[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Seed script (`python -m app.seed`) for the reference instrument catalog[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Audit logging for security-relevant events[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Health endpoint reporting DB + Redis status[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Typed request/response models, consistent error responses, versioned API (`/api/v1`)[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Frontend** (`frontend/`, Next.js 15 + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui)[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Landing page, login, register, dashboard[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Dashboard: account card, portfolios section (create/delete), market quotes[m
[32m+[m[32m    card (live simulated quotes, mock-labelled), system status[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Reverse proxy: `/api/*` → backend (no CORS issues, single entry point)[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Light + dark themes, responsive layout[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Deployment**[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Dockerfiles for backend and frontend[m
[32m+[m[32m  - `docker-compose.yml`: PostgreSQL 16, Redis 7, backend, frontend, Nginx[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Nginx terminates at port 80 and routes `/` → frontend, `/api/` → backend (WebSocket upgrade ready)[m
[32m+[m[32m- **CI** (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`)[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Backend: ruff lint, pytest against real Postgres + Redis, migration up/down/up[m
[32m+[m[32m  - Frontend: typecheck, eslint, production build[m
[32m+[m
